#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:5 969c9335218e478c9e05a27bab3ab351
msgid "AutoTune"
msgstr "AutoTune"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:7 508457c94d2e467d8ff2159b24fb09c3
msgid ""
"AutoTune attempts to automatically tune the Stabilize P, Rate P and D, and "
"maximum rotational accelerations to provide the highest response without "
"significant overshoot. Copter needs to be \"basically\" flyable in "
":ref:`AltHold mode <altholdmode>` before attempting to use AutoTune as the "
"feature needs to be able to \"twitch\" the copter in the roll and pitch "
"axis."
msgstr ""
"AutoTune尝试自动调整Stabilize P、Rate "
"P和D，以及最大旋转加速度，以在无显著超调的情况下提供最高响应。飞行器在尝试使用AutoTune之前需要在 :ref:`AltHold模式 "
"<altholdmode>` 下\"基本\"可以飞行，因为该功能需要能够在横滚和俯仰轴上\"抽动\"飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:11 c297d05e83804a40bed9ec85c1937b5e
msgid ""
"AutoTune is not always able to determine a good tune for the vehicle and may"
" result in gains that lead to an unflyable vehicle that may crash.  Please "
"follow the :ref:`Tuning Process Instructions <tuning-process-instructions>` "
"before attempting to use AutoTune. After following those instructions, and "
"have :ref:`evaluated your initial tune <evaluating-the-aircraft-tune>`, "
"should to try AutoTune."
msgstr ""
"AutoTune并非总能为飞行器确定良好的调参结果，可能产生导致飞行器无法飞行并可能坠毁的增益。请在尝试使用AutoTune之前按照 "
":ref:`调参过程说明 <tuning-process-instructions>` 操作，并在 :ref:`评估初始调参 <evaluating-"
"the-aircraft-tune>` 后，再尝试AutoTune。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:13 bcf791fded354fdeaca3ecfabb599491
msgid ""
"using :ref:`quiktune` before AUTOTUNE, AND setting up the noise notch "
"filtering, see :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering`, is highly recommended in "
"order to get the best tune and avoid possible crashes when using AUTOTUNE."
msgstr ""
"强烈建议在使用AUTOTUNE之前先使用 :ref:`quiktune`，并设置噪声陷波滤波（参见 :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering`），以获得最佳调参效果并避免使用AUTOTUNE时可能发生的坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:19 d649c1c4f39e488ba51e8c04b2a81607
msgid ""
"There are number of problems that can prevent AutoTune from providing a good"
" tune including:"
msgstr "有许多问题可能阻止AutoTune提供良好的调参，包括："

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:21 c17c7398385449b5ae4da1e1f05f8947
msgid "Strong wind"
msgstr "强风"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:22 1a00e52f63d7467e95a3f8885ebabd26
msgid "High levels of gyro noise"
msgstr "较高的陀螺仪噪声"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:23 22006181f0324be99b978d94fc90187c
msgid ""
"Non-linear ESC response caused by the incorrect value of :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO"
" <MOT_THST_EXPO>`"
msgstr "由 :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` 设置值不正确导致的非线性ESC响应"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:24 6af20f79653d4e3eb9cc1626fd8d95d8
msgid "Flexible frame or payload mount"
msgstr "机架或载荷安装架柔性过大"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:25 69c00d907300432c8de2b92b9d6cc99d
msgid "Overly flexible vibration isolation mount"
msgstr "减震安装架过于柔性"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:26 72cd3825ee784eafa0bc8a3f778f5500
msgid "Very low setting for :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>`"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` 设置值过低"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:27 5813658b2d084b50b3da6df1fd80c8a1
msgid "Overloaded propellers or motors"
msgstr "螺旋桨或电机过载"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:30 2f48bbe0c31f4bc5878cf41f728e5086
msgid "Setup before flying in AutoTune mode"
msgstr "飞行AutoTune模式前的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:32 11935df18fc04b1b90c2bdcfc5e26874
msgid "Set up one flight mode switch position to be AltHold."
msgstr "将一个飞行模式开关位置设置为AltHold。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:33 2d747ab9031841369a21d54d95cf21ea
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Set an RC channel :ref:`Auxiliary Function <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"switch to AutoTune to allow you to turn the auto tuning on/off with a "
"switch."
msgstr ""
"将RC通道的 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"开关设置为AutoTune，以便通过开关打开/关闭自动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:35 3fe842b540664fc8bf71049184218eea
msgid ""
"you can also set the AUTOTUNE flight mode as a mode on your flight mode "
"switch to activate AutoTune"
msgstr "您也可以在飞行模式开关上将AUTOTUNE飞行模式设置为一个模式来激活AutoTune。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:37 b90061e6d56543c7966556fd01b1fecf
msgid ""
"Remove the camera gimbal or any other parts of the frame that could wobble "
"in flight"
msgstr "拆除相机云台或机架上任何可能在飞行中晃动的部件。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:38 8601d0b882bc404b9c080996a6977c83
msgid ""
"Select which combination of axes (roll, pitch, yaw) you wish to tune using "
"the :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AXES <AUTOTUNE_AXES__AC_AutoTune_Multi>` parameter"
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AXES <AUTOTUNE_AXES__AC_AutoTune_Multi>` "
"参数选择要调参的轴（横滚、俯仰、偏航）的组合。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:39 65223c1e02a743c5b2fbbd3fd4411b38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Set the autotune's aggressiveness using the :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR "
"<AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` parameter (0.1=aggressive, 0.075=medium, 0.050=weak), "
"normally start with the default 0.1."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` "
"参数设置AutoTune的激进程度（0.1=激进，0.075=中等，0.050=温和），通常从默认值0.1开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:40 53f22db6d88d44fba10e540af50798ee
msgid ""
"For large copters (with props at least 13inch or 33cm diameter) set the Rate"
" Roll and Pitch filters to 10hz, these are: :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT "
"<ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`, "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD<ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`, "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT <ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`, "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD <ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"
msgstr ""
"对于大型飞行器（螺旋桨直径至少13英寸或33厘米），将横滚和俯仰的Rate滤波器设置为10Hz，这些参数为：:ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT"
" "
"<ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`、:ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD<ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`、:ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT"
" <ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`、:ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD "
"<ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:41 f3dd25e7e66b41378d6e7c092c2557e5
msgid ""
"It is recommended to enable :ref:`battery voltage scaling of PID gains "
"<current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling>`"
msgstr "建议启用 :ref:`PID增益的电池电压缩放 <current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:44 3fd1ea60ff3644d49e4c7a0c4361559a
msgid "How to invoke AutoTune"
msgstr "如何启动AutoTune"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:46 c7d1bc1725c94984a25f260344b940a6
msgid "Wait for a calm day and go to a large open area."
msgstr "等待风平浪静的天气，前往宽阔的开阔地。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:47 17e49cd6b542442295b47e1978d7e416
msgid "Ensure the Aux AUTOTUNE switch, if used, is in the LOW position."
msgstr "确保辅助AUTOTUNE开关（如果使用）处于低位。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:48 ba27f49ff5cd4033b258c4640f290ff0
msgid ""
"Take off and put the copter into AltHold mode at a comfortable altitude."
msgstr "起飞并将飞行器切换到AltHold模式，保持舒适的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:50 713f00ed1dc547b9a8642fcb11d8c458
msgid ""
"Face the vehicle so that it will twitch at 90degrees from the direction the "
"wind is blowing (i.e. if tuning Roll first, point the vehicle into the wind)"
msgstr "调整飞行器朝向，使其在垂直于风向的方向上抽动（即如果先调横滚，让飞行器机头朝风）。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:55 ae4c1035b62643d68f255caccefe4e8a
msgid ""
"Set the AUX switch to the HIGH position, or switch to AUTOTUNE mode, to "
"engage auto tuning:"
msgstr "将辅助开关拨到高位，或切换到AUTOTUNE模式，以启动自动调参："

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:57 15479f8da8df4fbab4f33881b5850d42
msgid ""
"You will see it twitch about 20 degrees left and right for a few minutes, "
"then it will repeat forward and back."
msgstr "您将看到它左右各抽动约20度，持续几分钟，然后重复前后抽动。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:59 0c8c3fcf54c041dd96e5ed012d66f361
msgid ""
"Use the roll and pitch stick at any time to reposition the copter if it "
"drifts away (it will use the original PID gains during repositioning and "
"between tests).  When you release the sticks it will continue auto tuning "
"where it left off."
msgstr "随时使用横滚和俯仰摇杆重新定位飞行器（如果漂移，它将在重新定位期间和测试之间使用原始PID增益）。松开摇杆后，自动调参将从上次中断处继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:63 16c061bd6a1d49b7bec4687bca601e45
msgid ""
"Move the AUX switch into the LOW position, or change flight mode if using "
"AUTOTUNE flight mode, at any time to abandon the autotuning and return to "
"the origin PIDs."
msgstr "随时将辅助开关拨回低位，或在使用AUTOTUNE飞行模式时切换飞行模式，可放弃自动调参并恢复到原始PID。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:65 7ab30709d416490880d8e2cb0d486f57
msgid ""
"Make sure that you do not have any trim set on your transmitter or the "
"autotune may not get the signal that the sticks are centered."
msgstr "确保遥控器上没有设置任何微调，否则AutoTune可能无法接收到摇杆居中的信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:68 5aaf6e68191e45b6b99d461aca93fc07
msgid ""
"When the tune completes the copter will change back to the original PID "
"gains."
msgstr "调参完成后，飞行器将恢复到原始PID增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:70 f2a753bdd4f1499e8192615f667c2c2b
msgid ""
"Put the AUX switch into the LOW position and then back to the HIGH position "
"to test the tuned PID gains, or if using the AUTOTUNE flight mode, switch "
"out and then back into that mode."
msgstr "将辅助开关拨低再拨高，以测试调参后的PID增益；如果使用AUTOTUNE飞行模式，则切出再切回该模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:72 e47d785923214310b53c3bbec60d0d3a
msgid ""
"Put the AUXswitch into the LOW position, or switch out of AUTOTUNE flight "
"mode, to fly using the original PID gains."
msgstr "将辅助开关拨低，或切出AUTOTUNE飞行模式，使用原始PID增益飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:73 dd66baeba843458e980edc3b79fd1875
msgid ""
"If you are happy with the autotuned PID gains, leave the AUX switch in the "
"HIGH position, or switch back into AUTOTUNE flight mode and land and disarm "
"to save the PIDs permanently."
msgstr "如果您对自动调参的PID增益满意，将辅助开关保持在高位，或切回AUTOTUNE飞行模式，然后降落并上锁以永久保存PID。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:76 90f1957d165d41a5b88bd7627f406357
msgid ""
"If you DO NOT like the new PIDS, switch the AUX switch LOW or out of "
"AUTOTUNE flight mode, to return to the original PIDs. The gains will not be "
"saved when you disarm."
msgstr "如果您不满意新的PID，将辅助开关拨低或切出AUTOTUNE飞行模式，恢复到原始PID。上锁时增益将不会被保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:78 09bbacbd2fdb4c85b6ae5710d24d22da
msgid ""
"If you find after performing an AutoTune that the vehicle feels overly "
"twitchy when flying Stabilize, AltHold or PosHold (but ok in more autonomous"
" modes like Loiter, RTL, Auto) try increasing the "
":ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC<ATC_INPUT_TC>` parameter to 0.25.  This smooths out the "
"pilot's input. Alternatively try reducing the :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR "
"<AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` parameter (it should always be in the range 0.05 to 0.10) "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"如果在执行AutoTune后发现飞行器在Stabilize、AltHold或PosHold模式下感觉过于抽动（但在Loiter、RTL、Auto等自主模式下正常），请尝试将"
" :ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC<ATC_INPUT_TC>` 参数增大到0.25。这会平滑飞手的输入。或者尝试减小 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` 参数（应始终在0.05至0.10范围内）并再次尝试。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:82 f9ede0a889744d3cbe17f91ec3702601
msgid ""
"If the vehicle feels sloppy after the AutoTune, try increasing the "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` parameter as high as 0.10 and attempt "
"the autotune again."
msgstr ""
"如果AutoTune后飞行器感觉松软，尝试将 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` "
"参数增大至最高0.10并再次尝试AutoTune。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:85 046fecf32a424265aaa622ad577da8a2
msgid "Invoke AutoTune with Position Hold"
msgstr "使用位置保持启动AutoTune"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:89 29988ad8d2f14ac8b4fdf5fdf76e4ce9
msgid ""
"A better tune can often be achieved by invoking AutoTune from AltHold as "
"described above instead of from Loiter or PosHold as described below. Using "
"AUTOTUNE flight mode also has this possible disadvantage."
msgstr ""
"如上所述从AltHold启动AutoTune通常比从Loiter或PosHold（如下所述）启动能获得更好的调参结果。使用AUTOTUNE飞行模式也有这种可能的缺点。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:91 9a5358a8beea4440953750f9f5435d33
msgid ""
"AutoTune performs a weak position hold if invoked from Loiter or PosHold "
"flight modes (as opposed to AltHold) while doing an autotune. If using the "
"AUTOTUNE flight mode, this weak position hold is also used."
msgstr ""
"AutoTune如果从Loiter或PosHold飞行模式（相对于AltHold）启动，会在自动调参期间执行弱位置保持。如果使用AUTOTUNE飞行模式，也会使用这种弱位置保持。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:97 c92f4fe7bd31485ea2ed29a9a1e6dbeb
msgid ""
"The vehicle will gently lean (up to 10 degrees) towards a \"target point\" "
"which is initially set to the vehicle's location at the moment AutoTune was "
"invoked."
msgstr "飞行器会轻轻倾斜（最多10度）朝向一个\"目标点\"，该目标点在启动AutoTune时设置为飞行器的当前位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:98 6c3f7dd240f044ce97486c50de756daa
msgid ""
"The pilot can reposition the vehicle using the roll, pitch, yaw or throttle "
"sticks.  The target position will be reset to the vehicle's location at the "
"moment the pilot releases the roll and pitch sticks."
msgstr "飞手可以使用横滚、俯仰、偏航或油门摇杆重新定位飞行器。目标位置将在飞手松开横滚和俯仰摇杆时重置为飞行器的当前位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:99 90a77ba0696540f49b326f38056e703f
#, fuzzy, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The altitude is maintained with the altitude hold controller so the vehicle "
"will attempt to hold its current altitude when the sticks are placed with "
"10% of mid-throttle. It will climb or descend at up to 2.5m/s (this speed is"
" adjustable with the :ref:`PILOT_SPD_UP<PILOT_SPD_UP>` and "
":ref:`PILOT_SPD_DN<PILOT_SPD_DN>` parameters). The acceleration used to "
"establish these speeds is set by :ref:`PILOT_ACC_Z<PILOT_ACC_Z>`."
msgstr ""
"高度由高度保持控制器维持，当摇杆处于中位油门 10% 范围内时，飞行器将尝试保持当前高度。飞行器可以以最高 2.5m/s 的速度爬升或下降（此速度可通过"
" :ref:`PILOT_SPEED_UP<PILOT_SPEED_UP>` 和 "
":ref:`PILOT_SPEED_DN<PILOT_SPEED_DN>` 参数调整）。用于达到这些速度的加速度由 "
":ref:`PILOT_ACCEL_Z<PILOT_ACCEL_Z>` 设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:104 29716c9c0e324bb087a4e6ce2c7b4ce5
msgid ""
"To twitch perpendicular to the wind direction, the vehicle may suddenly "
"rotate in either direction up to 90 degrees as it drifts 5m (or more) from "
"the target location."
msgstr "为了垂直于风向抽动，当飞行器从目标位置漂移超过5m（或更多）时，飞行器可能突然朝任一方向旋转最多90度。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:105 80dbb80ece5144c28477ae0842327dcb
msgid ""
"If there is little or no wind, the vehicle's gentle position control may "
"mean it moves back and forth, ping-ponging around the target point changing "
"yaw each time it strays more than 5m from the target.  In these cases, it "
"may be more comfortable to revert to the simpler AltHold-based AutoTune."
msgstr ""
"如果风力很小或没有风，飞行器的轻柔位置控制可能会使其来回运动，当偏离目标点超过5m时每次都会偏航改变方向，来回摆动。在这种情况下，恢复到更简单的基于AltHold的AutoTune可能更舒适。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:108 9ccb3a78fef840be952a2e9143e246c8
msgid "Testing Tune in Other Modes"
msgstr "在其他模式下测试调参效果"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:110 898351e2c940497da3641687dfec2b3d
msgid ""
"The completed suceesfull tune obtained can be tested in any mode, not just "
"the one (ALTHOLD or LOITER) used for entry. A switch can be "
"setup,``RCx_OPTION`` = 180 (AUTOTUNE_TEST_GAINS) that will allow switching "
"between original and autotuned gains in any mode, after autotune has "
"completed. If this switch is setup, but not changed after the auotune has "
"completed, it has no effect. Otherwise if switched high the tuned gains are "
"in effect, if low the original gains. Then they apply to any flight mode and"
" will be made permanent upon the next disarm, based on  switch position."
msgstr ""
"成功完成的调参可以在任何模式下测试，不仅限于用于进入的模式（ALTHOLD或LOITER）。可以设置一个开关，``RCx_OPTION`` = "
"180（AUTOTUNE_TEST_GAINS），AutoTune完成后允许在任何模式下切换原始增益和自动调参增益。如果设置了此开关但AutoTune完成后未更改，则无效果。否则，开关拨高则使用调参增益，拨低则使用原始增益。这些增益适用于任何飞行模式，并将在下次上锁时根据开关位置永久生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:113 6f0277bfc4fc4ddaa0d4538592930238
msgid "If AutoTune fails"
msgstr "AutoTune失败时"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:115 bb603dfa04574d0dbb5c3d41345560e1
msgid "If AutoTune has failed you will need to do a manual tune."
msgstr "如果AutoTune失败，您需要进行手动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:117 a9b6077c69ae4e048a74c15fe8447551
msgid ""
"Some signs that AutoTune has been successful are (besides DataFlash logs and"
" Ground Control Station messages):"
msgstr "AutoTune成功的一些迹象（除DataFlash日志和地面站消息外）："

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:119 0f5a1afff38640ba9cba68ae342b83ce
msgid ""
"An increase in the values of :ref:`ATC_ANG_PIT_P <ATC_ANG_PIT_P>` and "
":ref:`ATC_ANG_RLL_P <ATC_ANG_RLL_P>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_ANG_PIT_P <ATC_ANG_PIT_P>` 和 :ref:`ATC_ANG_RLL_P <ATC_ANG_RLL_P>` "
"的值增大。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:120 1dda6ae5857e4d38a0695931663914b9
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_D <ATC_RAT_PIT_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>` and "
