#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:154 b52eb20785a64ca4906c15b616670768
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The AUTOTUNE algorithm tries to tune until instability is noted and then "
"backs off the final PID values to provide a margin of stability. This back-"
"off percentage can be manipulated with the :ref:`AUTOTUNE_GMBK "
"<AUTOTUNE_GMBK>` parameter and changed from its default value of 25% "
"reduction in gains, in order to get a tune with more, or less, stability "
"margin."
msgstr ""
"AUTOTUNE 算法会持续调参直至检测到不稳定，然后回退最终 PID 值以留出稳定裕度。该回退百分比可通过 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_GMBK "
"<AUTOTUNE_GMBK>` 参数调整，从其默认值（增益降低 25%）改为其他值，以获得稳定裕度更大或更小的调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:155 a8a213794aa24346b98c91b57743158e
msgid ""
"After you have a good tune, you may wish to increase :ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAX "
"<ATC_THR_MIX_MAX>`  to 0.9 (default is 0.5) to increase prioritization of "
"attitude control over throttle.  This can reduce the pitch overshoot "
"sometimes seen (especially on copters with large propellers) in AltHold if "
"the vehicle suddenly slows after performing a fast forward flight.  In this "
"situation, wind catches under the propellers providing lift but also "
"disturbs the vehicle's attitude leading to a conflict between throttle and "
"attitude control.  The danger in increasing this parameter's value is that "
"if the rate gains are later raised so high that the vehicle oscillates badly"
" it may be difficult for the vehicle to descend (because it will prioritize "
"trying to correct the attitude oscillations and never reduce throttle "
"sufficiently)."
msgstr ""
"获得良好调参后，您可能希望将 :ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAX <ATC_THR_MIX_MAX>` "
"增大到0.9（默认为0.5），以提高姿态控制对油门的优先级。这可以减少有时在AltHold中（尤其是大螺旋桨飞行器）高速前飞后突然减速时出现的俯仰超调。在这种情况下，风从螺旋桨下方进入提供升力，但也扰乱了飞行器姿态，导致油门与姿态控制之间产生冲突。增大此参数值的风险在于，如果之后角速度增益提高到飞行器剧烈震荡，可能会难以下降（因为它会优先尝试纠正姿态震荡而从不充分降低油门）。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:156 ad307889fabe409b8865d50018562328
msgid ""
"AutoTune can **request very large and fast changes in output**\\ s to the "
"motors which can cause ESC sync issues especially when using SimonK firmware"
" and/or low KV motors (under 500KV). See this `video showing a test "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBUBbeyLe0Q>`__ which recreates a sync "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"AutoTune可能 "
"**请求对电机进行非常大且快速的输出变化**，这可能导致ESC同步问题，尤其是使用SimonK固件和/或低KV电机（低于500KV）时。请参见此 "
"`视频测试 <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBUBbeyLe0Q>`__ ，其中重现了同步问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:157 ae470934042e42068255b4fca0a8e4af
msgid ""
"For best results, the copter shouldn't be allowed to build up too much "
"horizontal speed. This can be prevented by applying a quick correction "
"between tests (twitches) to stop the vehicle from flying too fast."
msgstr "为获得最佳结果，飞行器不应积累过多水平速度。可以在测试（抽动）之间快速纠正，以防止飞行器飞得太快。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:158 9222e9156c6545cc999bdf933cc94421
msgid ""
"Be advised that AutoTune will engage from Stabilize, so don't accidentally "
"flip your AutoTune switch until you are in AltHold and ready to begin the "
"procedure."
msgstr "请注意，AutoTune可以从Stabilize模式激活，因此在准备好进入AltHold并开始程序之前，不要意外拨动AutoTune开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:159 2b2700a7251b44a7b3d67a492d7e0b76
msgid ""
"As a general rule, for Pitch and Roll, P and I should be equal, and D should"
" be 1/10th P. For Yaw, I should be 1/10th P and D = 0, in most cases."
msgstr "一般规则：对于俯仰和横滚，P和I应相等，D应为P的1/10。对于偏航，I应为P的1/10，D在大多数情况下为0。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:162 7d866ff21a6e427da230c66bfbffed7e
msgid "Common Problems"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:164 9067e80f466543f980e061e031c01cd8
msgid ""
"If the vehicle will not start tuning (i.e. it won't twitch) even though it "
"is in AutoTune mode then the problem is likely that the roll, pitch, yaw or "
"throttle sticks are not exactly in the middle. It may help to increase the "
"deadzone on the RC input by increasing :ref:`RC1_DZ <RC1_DZ>`, :ref:`RC2_DZ "
"<RC2_DZ>`, :ref:`RC3_DZ <RC3_DZ>` and :ref:`RC4_DZ <RC4_DZ>` to 50 (or "
"higher)."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器即使在AutoTune模式下也不开始调参（即不抽动），问题可能是横滚、俯仰、偏航或油门摇杆不完全居中。尝试通过将 :ref:`RC1_DZ "
"<RC1_DZ>`、:ref:`RC2_DZ <RC2_DZ>`、:ref:`RC3_DZ <RC3_DZ>` 和 :ref:`RC4_DZ "
"<RC4_DZ>` 增大到50（或更高）来增大RC输入的死区可能有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:165 563572f91bfe40e5a4f6ad812fab84b2
msgid ""
"If the AutoTune produces an overly twitchy vehicle try reducing the "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` parameter (should never be below 0.05) "
"and perform the AutoTune again."
msgstr ""
"如果AutoTune产生过于抽动的飞行器，尝试减小 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` "
"参数（不应低于0.05）并再次执行AutoTune。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:166 86a123e0347c41fab69a0fdefadeebd2
msgid ""
"If the AutoTune produces a sloppy vehicle, try increasing the "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` parameter (should never be above 0.1) "
"and perform the AutoTune again."
msgstr ""
"如果AutoTune产生松软的飞行器，尝试增大 :ref:`AUTOTUNE_AGGR <AUTOTUNE_AGGR>` "
"参数（不应高于0.1）并再次执行AutoTune。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:170 8b1d89b157014b0f8ab0a7cb6ad27cbf
msgid ""
"When reporting issues with AutoTune please include a description of your "
"frame and a ``.bin`` dataflash log of the flight."
msgstr "报告AutoTune问题时，请附上机架描述和飞行的 ``.bin`` Dataflash日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:173 76abb1eb60f84b2a8871363f94e1f360
msgid "Dataflash logging"
msgstr "Dataflash日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:175 9265c28c88ab4e50b17424d9774c55da
msgid ""
"ATUN (auto tune overview) and ATDE (auto tune details) messages are written "
"to the dataflash logs. Some details of the contents of those messages can be"
" found on the :ref:`Downloading and Analyzing Data Logs in Mission Planner "
"<common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner_message_details_copter_specific>` wiki page."
msgstr ""
"ATUN（自动调参概述）和ATDE（自动调参详情）消息会写入Dataflash日志。这些消息内容的一些详情可以在 :ref:`在Mission "
"Planner中下载和分析数据日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner_message_details_copter_specific>` wiki页面找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:180 ea7aadbad67a4028a078f31fbbef5917
msgid "Ground Control Station Messages"
msgstr "地面站消息"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:182 6f2fa1e5907f4251a547de43879216dd
msgid ""
"For each axis, there are several phases to the tune. Rate PIDs are adjusted "
"first, then ANGLE parameters. Progress messages during these phases are sent"
" to the GCS (and recorded in the Dataflash logs)."
msgstr ""
"对于每个轴，调参有几个阶段。首先调整角速度PID，然后调整姿态角参数。这些阶段期间的进度消息将发送到地面站（并记录在Dataflash日志中）。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:184 41d4fd6761e84ba298074c2cca779d55
msgid "The typical sequence during tuning might be:"
msgstr "调参期间的典型序列可能是："

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:194 d47047a60bdc49e18dc48821a936b364
msgid ""
"This is during Pitch Rate P adjustment, indicating a twitch is about to "
"happen as the P is being tried at an increased value of 0.052298, but first,"
" it is waiting until it gets back to level from the last twitch (WFL= "
"Waiting for level), and then it reports that the result of this twitch is "
"within targets and successful. But this has to occur 4 times in a row, "
"before moving on to the next phase."
msgstr ""
"这是在俯仰角速度P调整期间，表明随着P以0.052298的增大值进行尝试，抽动即将发生，但首先等待从上次抽动恢复水平（WFL=等待水平），然后报告此次抽动的结果在目标范围内且成功。但这必须连续发生4次，才能进入下一阶段。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:196 bcdd773b3950476593607362ef069169
msgid ""
"During the YAW rate phase of tuning, the messages will show a value for "
"\"d\" that is not ATC_RAT_YAW_D, which is usually 0, but rather it's the "
"value of ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTE, that is being changed."
msgstr "在偏航角速度调参阶段，消息中显示的\"d\"值不是ATC_RAT_YAW_D（通常为0），而是正在更改的ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTE的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:198 535fa652d51f4083a86103ad2861677d
#, fuzzy
msgid "Anytime the process is interrupted by pilot stick movements, the"
msgstr "每当过程被飞手摇杆操作中断时，就会出现以下信息：:："

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:204 a4abba94662541779c701aa3e36d8064
msgid "message appears."
msgstr "出现该消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:206 cc4be6818ef04a699b7b457e45e06f31
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you stopped the tune and dis-armed while still in AUTOTUNE, and an axis "
"tune has been completed, you will get a message showing that the new gains "
"have been saved for that axis. If there is not a message to this effect, but"
" think you finished at least one axis, then you probably dis-armed while not"
" in AUTOTUNE mode, and did not actually save them."
msgstr ""
"如果您停止调参并在仍处于AUTOTUNE状态时上锁，且某轴调参已完成，您将收到一条消息，显示该轴的新增益已保存。如果没有此类消息，但您认为至少完成了一个轴，那么您可能是在非AUTOTUNE模式下上锁的，实际上没有保存。::"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune.rst:212 6c2e1152658f4cabbaa87623e0d5de4c
msgid ""
"If you do happen to accidentally discard a session's AUTOTUNE values by "
"disarming when not in AUTOTUNE, you can examine the dataflash log for the "
"GCS messages it sent during the tune and manually set them on the bench."
msgstr ""
"如果您意外地在非AUTOTUNE模式下上锁，丢弃了某次调参会话的AUTOTUNE值，您可以检查Dataflash日志中调参期间发送的GCS消息，然后在地面手动设置这些值。"
